src/ondewo-nlu-api

# Never publish test files or test build output.
# The release publishes ./npm (see the Makefile's npm_release), and that directory gets its own
# equivalent .npmignore written by create_npm_package -- these patterns keep a `npm publish` run
# from the repo root safe too. Slash-free patterns match at any depth.
*.spec.*
*.test.*
.test-build/
